<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces stormed a supermarket in Cartagena, freeing 20 hostages after gunmen held them for 17 hours and killing one attacker. The president blamed ex-FARC rebels for a car bomb that injured more than 20 people in a central city and for another bomb at the governor's office in Meta. The ELN carried out a drone strike on a police base, wounding three people, including an infant. Violence remains high, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/24/cartagena-colombia-hostages-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168864&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQZjllYmc4d3BxVVllMVktbjRjZFNNM3lpMktuN21WR3pLV3dfcTRjdzF5OXJhOU9OazhweFNLRm5DWXF3TkNWdzFQT1Fyak9ScGtIWnJ1Zk9nQmN6YThEcjJyV2Nydzc2ZmlSUWp0V2FjcEpMbUZJU0hsV25qeHNhUGZ2TnNIemxPaVhLcHVjeVowVnZZdGVteUtZUGpFMUw2ZklZSE9UMjJuNjFUNGh6N0Z3R3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/25/hostages-freed-colombia-security-forces-storm-cartagena-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPUXk2MmFURDEwYmxvTFItajUwUC1YQWVXMDNYSXh5MTBDV1A5Y1ROb1FRajhCTVZQMkh6SnRXNmJENElGOWVnLXFqSWFqLXZleTRwc2RieDFvYzRGWDRHd2ZmclFVSzk3NFN0bmI3ZkJtbHJfNV81dWtoeWEzNmVvN3dpZ0Q4dF8zVjV3WU1xOXpPMHRUVnNzMjd1REx0ZHloZ29ZWjlNajVwSS1LeTBHek9WSmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lx